or potentially form pungs if I draw more T7s, T8s, or T9s. T1 is the least useful tile as it's isolated and has limited combination potential with my current hand. The T2 could theoretically form T1-T2-T3, but with only 2 T3s unshown and needing both T1 and T3, this is much less likely than completing patterns with my T7-T8-T9 cluster.\n\nAnswer: Play T1"}
