iminates the isolated tile and allows me to focus on Bamboo tiles T7-T8-T9, giving me multiple winning opportunities. With 4 T7s, 3 T6s, 3 T8s, and 2 T9s still unshown, I have good chances to complete winning patterns like T6-T7-T8 or T7-T8-T9 chows while keeping pairs.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
